requirements/main.req.inset:5:9-5:62
`Item` is compared here, and does not derive `PartialEq` and `Debug`
compared as an `Item`
help: a type compared in a requirement derives `PartialEq` and `Debug`, so a failed test can show both values: add `PartialEq` and `Debug` to the `#[derive]` of `Item`
